    <div1 type="chapter" title="Chapter 10" n="iii" shorttitle="chapter iii" progress="39%" prev="ii" next="iii.i" id="iii">
      <p class="BOOK-CHAP-BLU-24-CEN13" id="iii-p1">The Sum of the Law</p>
      <div2 type="scripture" title="Deuteronomy 10:12,13" n="i" shorttitle="scripture i" progress="39%" prev="iii" next="iii.ii" id="iii.i">
        <table border="2" id="iii.i-p1.2">
          <tr id="iii.i-p1.3" valign="top">
            <td colspan="1" id="iii.i-p1.4" rowspan="1">
              <p class="TableCaption14" id="iii.i-p2"><scripRef id="iii.i-p2.1" osisRef="Bible:Deut.10.12-Deut.10.13" parsed="|Deut|10|12|10|13" passage="Deuteronomy 10:12, 13">Deuteronomy 10:12, 13</scripRef></p>
            </td>
          </tr>
          <tr id="iii.i-p2.2" valign="top">
            <td colspan="1" id="iii.i-p2.3" rowspan="1">
              <p class="TableText15" id="iii.i-p3"><b>12.</b> And now, Israel, what doth the Lord thy God require of thee.</p>
            </td>
          </tr>
        </table>

        <p id="iii.i-p11"> </p>

        <p id="iii.i-p12"><scripCom id="iii.i-p12.1" osisRef="Bible:Deut.10.12" parsed="|Deut|10|12|0|0" passage="De 10:12" type="Commentary" /></p><div class="Commentary" id="iii.i-p12.3">
          <p id="iii.i-p13"><b>12.</b> A NORMAL, unmarked scripCom marker with no sibling at all -- confirmed real content, verse 12, baseline case that already worked before this round's fix.</p>
        </div>

        <p id="iii.i-p14"><scripCom id="iii.i-p14.1" osisRef="Bible:Deut.10.13" parsed="|Deut|10|13|0|0" passage="De 10:13" type="Commentary" /><a id="iii.i-p14.2" shape="rect" xml:link="simple" /></p><div class="Commentary" id="iii.i-p14.3">
          <p id="iii.i-p15"><b>13.</b> The real, confirmed bug case: a harmless empty anchor sibling next to scripCom, verse 13 -- this whole paragraph used to be silently dropped because the marker was not recognized.</p>
        </div>

        <p id="iii.i-p16"><scripCom id="iii.i-p16.1" osisRef="Bible:Deut.10.14" parsed="|Deut|10|14|0|0" passage="De 10:14" type="Commentary" /><b id="iii.i-p16.2">stray</b></p><div class="Commentary" id="iii.i-p16.3">
          <p id="iii.i-p17"><b>14.</b> A genuinely ambiguous sibling (real text content, not harmless) -- must still be rejected as a marker, not folded in permissively.</p>
        </div>
      </div2>
    </div1>
